        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "- DC_CableCheck timing: The monitoring of the cable check is carried out by the EV using the V2G_EVCC_DC_CableCheck_Timer. It is started when the EV requests the EVSE to start the Cable Check, and ends when the EVSE has finished the cable check, or when the V2G EVCC DC CableCheck Timer expires:",
            "block_bbox": [
                104,
