        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "- DC_PreCharge timing: The monitoring of the pre charge is carried out by the EV using the V2G_EVCC_DC_PreCharge_Timer. It is started when the EV starts the pre charging by sending the first DC_PreChargeReq message, and ends when the pre charging has finished, indicated by the EV determining that the EVSE output voltage, as measured inside the EV, has sufficiently been adjusted to the EV RESS voltage, or when the V2G_EVCC_DC_PreCharge_Timer expires.",
